      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Internal pressures of bone tumors and tumorous conditions were measured in 20 patients. High pressures were frequently found in patients with painful bone lesions while low pressures were common in patients with no pain. Internal hypertension may be a causative factor of aching bone pain at rest."},
